<title>USA: Fannie Mae ups the size of REMIC 1997-29.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae ups the size of REMIC 1997-29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae on Friday said it has increased the size of a previously issued series of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-29, issued via Paine Webber, was increased to $500 million from $250 million, the agency said. The issue is backed by 30-year, 7.5 percent mortgage-backed securities. The issue has a settlement date of April 30, Fannie Mae said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
